   automaton, retrieved via
   https://github.com/EZLiang/vonNeumannTuringMachine (MIT), itself derived
   from John von Neumann's *Theory of Self-Reproducing Automata*
   (A. W. Burks, ed., 1966). The transition data is reproduced verbatim for
   auditability; see the provenance header inside the file.

